# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working material, deliberately not published.
#
# `work/` holds raw generator output and the loud volume-matched review copies
# used to audition the sound; `outputs/` holds early visual-direction stills
# and a motion study. Neither is used by the live site, both are large, and
# their redistribution rights are unresolved. See ASSET_CREDITS.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
work/
outputs/

# Generated video and stills from the abandoned video-led approach. Nothing in
